(7707579, 1266049, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is a very well done still life.  The lighting is captured well and the objects and colors appealing.  I am noIt fond of the lemons, as they look out of place and the color too bright.  I also might have left out the pestle, but that is just me.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very well done still life.  The lighting is captured well and the objects and colors appealing.  I am noIt fond of the lemons, as they look out of place and the color too bright.  I also might have left out the pestle, but that is just me.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2021-11-25 17:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
