(7707587, 1266028, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image has the warm, quiet glow that epitomizes Mary Ann''s still lifes.  The objects, well-chosen as they are, are nicely balanced and composed.  The light is a big part of the pleasure of viewing it.  The table and background work beautifully in encompassing the whole.  If this is not done by Mary Ann, then whoever has devised such a charming still life has certainly absorbed her wonderful guidance, along with a natural talent.

<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This image has the warm, quiet glow that epitomizes Mary Ann''s still lifes.  The objects, well-chosen as they are, are nicely balanced and composed.  The light is a big part of the pleasure of viewing it.  The table and background work beautifully in encompassing the whole.  If this is not done by Mary Ann, then whoever has devised such a charming still life has certainly absorbed her wonderful guidance, along with a natural talent.

Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-11-25 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
