(7707597, 1265957, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is one of two personal co-favorites, so my quibbles don''t detract from how much I do enjoy it. The two larger onions and the paper bag are terrific, as is the lighting.  The bowl is a fine one, and I understand the desire for such a placement, but it''s a bit cumbersome, dominates the left, and is not done any favor by the tiny onion sitting on the dividing line of the piece of furniture.  The dividing line in the center of the background is distracting.

<br/>I hope these criticisms are seen for what they are, well-intentioned and a comparison of a stellar right hand of the image with the left.  It''s all subjective, of course.</td>', 'This is one of two personal co-favorites, so my quibbles don''t detract from how much I do enjoy it. The two larger onions and the paper bag are terrific, as is the lighting.  The bowl is a fine one, and I understand the desire for such a placement, but it''s a bit cumbersome, dominates the left, and is not done any favor by the tiny onion sitting on the dividing line of the piece of furniture.  The dividing line in the center of the background is distracting.

I hope these criticisms are seen for what they are, well-intentioned and a comparison of a stellar right hand of the image with the left.  It''s all subjective, of course.', '2021-11-25 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
