(7707601, 1266046, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully dreamy and creamy.  The carnations and the baby''s breath (?) don''t appear to work well together, mainly in size and height.  The use of the broken carnation, however, is bold and I like it.  I also like the dark background, with its out of focus details.</td>', 'Beautifully dreamy and creamy.  The carnations and the baby''s breath (?) don''t appear to work well together, mainly in size and height.  The use of the broken carnation, however, is bold and I like it.  I also like the dark background, with its out of focus details.', '2021-11-25 22:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707602, 1266015, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nicely thought out and composed.  The colors are lovely and harmonize.  I don''t know why the eggs are there, maybe a hen was sitting upon them, but it looks fine.</td>', 'Very nicely thought out and composed.  The colors are lovely and harmonize.  I don''t know why the eggs are there, maybe a hen was sitting upon them, but it looks fine.', '2021-11-25 23:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707604, 1266049, 50641, '<td valign="top">Good palette.  Like the eucalyptus and bottles.  Not as sure about the cut lemons and bookstomping.</td>', 'Good palette.  Like the eucalyptus and bottles.  Not as sure about the cut lemons and bookstomping.', '2021-11-25 23:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707605, 1266033, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image but for the uninteresting lineup of the honey jars.  Maybe if they were arranged in more casual fashion, with some other elements such as sprays of flowers, baked goods, etc..  The sunlight through them is beautiful, the light is strong and embracing, and the background perfectly sets them off.</td>', 'I like everything about this image but for the uninteresting lineup of the honey jars.  Maybe if they were arranged in more casual fashion, with some other elements such as sprays of flowers, baked goods, etc..  The sunlight through them is beautiful, the light is strong and embracing, and the background perfectly sets them off.', '2021-11-25 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707606, 1266029, 50641, '<td valign="top">Elegant yet luxurious.</td>', 'Elegant yet luxurious.', '2021-11-25 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707607, 1266028, 50641, '<td valign="top">Good devil may care random frazzled bits. Paleness and side lighting work well.</td>', 'Good devil may care random frazzled bits. Paleness and side lighting work well.', '2021-11-25 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707608, 1266014, 8759, '<td valign="top">beware of the donkey!</td>', 'beware of the donkey!', '2021-11-25 23:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707609, 1266049, 173844, '<td valign="top">As a study, the colors, the textures and lighting work well.  The separate elements do not seem to work together as a whole.  The tilted lemon half atop the left hand vase feels out of place, even if it was meant to be whimsical.  You certainly shoot a handsome still life, but more cohesiveness, harmony and planning will garner much appreciation.</td>', 'As a study, the colors, the textures and lighting work well.  The separate elements do not seem to work together as a whole.  The tilted lemon half atop the left hand vase feels out of place, even if it was meant to be whimsical.  You certainly shoot a handsome still life, but more cohesiveness, harmony and planning will garner much appreciation.', '2021-11-25 23:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707610, 1265986, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice berries. I''m wondering if playing with color channels might enhance some contrasts. But the red cast does give it mood.</td>', 'Nice berries. I''m wondering if playing with color channels might enhance some contrasts. But the red cast does give it mood.', '2021-11-25 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707611, 1265765, 50641, '<td valign="top">The flowers do look celebratory but the carved wood reminds me of a church or funeral parlor. I like the glowy fade.</td>', 'The flowers do look celebratory but the carved wood reminds me of a church or funeral parlor. I like the glowy fade.', '2021-11-25 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707612, 1265957, 50641, '<td valign="top">What''s in the bag, nighttrain?</td>', 'What''s in the bag, nighttrain?', '2021-11-25 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707613, 1266044, 50641, '<td valign="top">Great color combo. Something about the feng shui that niggles, but I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Great color combo. Something about the feng shui that niggles, but I can''t put my finger on it.', '2021-11-25 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707614, 1265998, 50641, '<td valign="top">Needs a mitre clamp.</td>', 'Needs a mitre clamp.', '2021-11-25 23:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7707615, 1266046, 50641, '<td valign="top">Like the softness.  Wonder how pulling back and going off center would feel.</td>', 'Like the softness.  Wonder how pulling back and going off center would feel.', '2021-11-25 23:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
